body:
@DragonOsman Thanks for posting your issue! I've moved it over to #1288 for further diagnosis.

Re: the NOMANGLE -- I _believe_ that's correct. In our CI, the current port for Wt is building just fine against the current port of Boost and I don't believe it has the NOMANGLE macro set. However, we do still patch out the reliance on boost autolinking[1].

[1] https://github.com/Microsoft/vcpkg/blob/687440f9760f3b9492de9a3105cdd6b99f9a3634/ports/wt/add-disable-boost-autolink-option.patch
